<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="en-US"><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">Number two.<break time="1350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-Iris:MAI-Voice-1">I signed up for the beginner yoga class that meets on Wednesday evenings.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-Grant:MAI-Voice-1">That class has moved to Thursday because the instructor is attending a training course. The starting time is still seven.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-Iris:MAI-Voice-1">Thursday works for me. Do I need to register again at the front desk?<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-Grant:MAI-Voice-1">No, your name is already on the new list. Just bring the same membership card.<break time="1300ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">Question.<break time="350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">What is true about the yoga class?</voice></speak>
